{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)getUserId","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getUserId","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"getUserId","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"getUserId"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/getuserid"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"getUserId","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The current user identifier (custom user ID or HWID)","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the user ID that was previously set via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"text":", or the HWID if no custom","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user ID has been set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Example","level":2,"anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync user ID with analytics platforms:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["class AnalyticsCoordinator {","","    func syncIdentifiers() {","        let userId = Pushwoosh.configure.getUserId()","        let hwid = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","","        \/\/ Sync with various analytics platforms","        Analytics.identify(userId)","        Crashlytics.setUserID(userId)","        MixpanelInstance.identify(distinctId: userId)","","        \/\/ Log device mapping for debugging","        Logger.debug(\"User identity: userId=\\(userId), hwid=\\(hwid)\")","    }","","    func trackEventWithUserContext(_ event: String, properties: [String: Any]) {","        var enrichedProperties = properties","        enrichedProperties[\"pushwoosh_user_id\"] = Pushwoosh.configure.getUserId()","        enrichedProperties[\"pushwoosh_hwid\"] = Pushwoosh.configure.getHWID()","","        Analytics.track(event, properties: enrichedProperties)","    }","}"]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Retrieves the current user identifier.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/getUserId","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/getUserId":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"getUserId"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/getuserid","title":"getUserId","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Retrieves the current user identifier.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/getUserId","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"getUserId"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"role":"collectio